   Instant Replay Installation Help


Overview
ÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜ

The user of this installation application
can select the sub-directory and drive to
which the demonstration files are installed.

Install Directory
ÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜ

Target Drive And Path
             -  This option selects the
                drive and path to which the
                demonstration files are
                installed.

 Example : If you wish the demonstration
           files to be installed on drive "C:"
           and sub-directory "DEMO".
           Enter into the Target Drive And Path
           "C:\DEMO".

Source Drive  - This option tells where the
               source files are located.

 Example : If the disk containing the
           demonstration files was inserted
           into drive "A:". The Source Drive
           option should be set to "DRIVE-A:".

Disk Space Available On DRIVE
             - This option tell the user
               how much disk space is
               currently available on the
               target drive.

 Example : If the Target Drive And Path option
           is set to "C:\DEMO" then this option
           tell the user how much disk space
           he or she has on drive "C:".

Disk Space Required
             - This option tells the user
               how much disk space is required
               on the target drive to install
               the demonstration files.

Installing Files
ÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜÜ

Currently Installing
             -  During the installation this
                options displays the file
                that is currently being
                installed.

Percent Complete
             - This options displays how far
               along the installation process
               is.